OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #1m to tackle city's
OL,4,Arough sleeping
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #1m has been ring-fenced to
OL,7,Fhelp people sleeping rough or at risk
OL,8,Fof homelessness in Worcester.
OL,10,FWorcester City Council was awarded
OL,11,F#1.3m through the government's Rough
OL,12,FSleeping Programme, and said the
OL,13,Ffunding would help those affected to
OL,14,Faccess accommodation and support.
OL,16,FThe authority added it would work with
OL,17,Fpartners across the city to provide
OL,18,F"proactive outreach, additional
OL,19,Faccommodation options and intensive
OL,20,Fsupport" aimed at helping people move
OL,21,Faway from rough sleeping for good.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
