OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #1m to tackle city's
OL,4,Arough sleeping
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Lynn Denham said:
OL,7,F"Tackling homelessness and rough
OL,8,Fsleeping is an absolute priority for
OL,9,Fthe city council and the dedicated
OL,10,Fnetwork of partners who work closely
OL,11,Fwith us."
